  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1439308/description_2ca0b763-8d24-4fc1-bd15-51b0e2c4dcdf.png\" width=\"701\" height=\"314\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/de599aa15aa3eb0a48c9f27bd7fecca30514529e.png\" width=\"613\" height=\"469\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae4ab31094c29c0c29dee6bbb8159468b27da7e6.png\" width=\"339\" height=\"80\"><br>(目前)<br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ddeacc7eed1aab503b5aaebed86b6613f83827e6.png\" width=\"668\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc4dccbf6f011302e31e1762bede41cad3de9fee.png\" width=\"668\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/73b0afc6b1343f8f415b0d6c7837d96d03bdf4bb.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<p>Boilerbox（锅炉车）控制：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/20af5d5f8b691a0575ff66a63f04a335373714fb.png\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p>Biplane（双翼机）控制：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/807a5d94b3d36f71c927f0898b13a6fdc43f262b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"668\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/97053c48b57242bd1a9454fc316fca13bd90cfd3.png\" width=\"492\" height=\"123\"><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dtmhn1i.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"391\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1439308/description_8fa2ee7e-124e-4d2a-adef-93a4c2b77696.png\" width=\"675\" height=\"1365\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>说明：</p>\n<hr>\n<p><br>Create: Automotives</p>\n<p>Create: Automotives 添加了虚构的蒸汽动力载具，其设计与《Create》模组的美术风格和进度体系完美契合。</p>\n<p>特色功能：<br>- 一款可驾驶的陆地载具<br>- 一款可飞行的飞机<br>- 升级系统（可选择专注于特定用途的模块）<br>- 《Create》风格集成（配方与进度系统）<br>- 丰富的音效、粒子效果及可交互元素</p>\n<p>入门指南：<br>1. 制作一台机械工作台以制作 Boilerbox / Biplane<br>2. 如有需要，使用机械工作台制作升级模块<br>3. 放置 Boilerbox / Biplane，并用岩浆桶为其左侧主油箱加注燃料<br>4. 右键点击绿色方块以安装升级模块<br>5. 右键座椅，然后右键左侧燃料阀门一次，或按住它直到燃烧器启动<br>6. 或者，你可以按 U 键打开控制面板并长按阀门。<br>7. 驾驶锅炉车使用 WASD 键。按空格键激活推进器。按 C 鸣响汽笛。按 N 启用/关闭手刹。如果在配置文件中禁用了自动换挡，则按 R/F 进行升档/降档。<br>8. 驾驶双翼机通过俯仰（W/S）、滚转（A/D）和偏航（J/L）来控制。油门由（I/K）控制。<br><br>额外操作：按 [V] 键切换武器，按 [空格] 键开火。<br><br>如何移除升级模块？<br>- 使用扳手物品左键点击升级模块！<br><br>如何拾取载具？<br>- 使用扳手物品，按住 Shift 键左键点击载具！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
